/T (The primary objective of this work is to develop an antenna system capable of operating at two distinct frequency bands while maintaining high performance in terms of gain, bandwidth, and isolation. Dual-band functionality allows the antenna to support multiple radar frequencies, thereby improving imaging capabilities and system flexibility.)
/E (The primary objective of this work is to develop an antenna system capable of operating at two distinct frequency bands while maintaining high performance in terms of gain, bandwidth, and isolation. Dual-band functionality allows the antenna to support multiple radar frequencies, thereby improving imaging capabilities and system flexibility.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [3]
>>
