/S /H2
/P 110 0 R
/T (In addition, dual polarization is incorporated in the antenna design to enhance signal diversity and reduce interference between channels, which is a critical requirement in MIMO systems. The antenna array is designed using a corporate feeding network, ensuring uniform power distribution among all radiating elements.)
/E (In addition, dual polarization is incorporated in the antenna design to enhance signal diversity and reduce interference between channels, which is a critical requirement in MIMO systems. The antenna array is designed using a corporate feeding network, ensuring uniform power distribution among all radiating elements.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
149 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 110 0 R
/T (The antenna structure is implemented using microstrip technology, which provides advantages such as compact size, low cost, ease of fabrication, and compatibility with printed circuit boards. The design and simulation are carried out using CST Microwave Studio, where key parameters such as return loss \(S-parameters\), gain, radiation pattern, and bandwidth are analyzed.)
/E (The antenna structure is implemented using microstrip technology, which provides advantages such as compact size, low cost, ease of fabrication, and compatibility with printed circuit boards. The design and simulation are carried out using CST Microwave Studio, where key parameters such as return loss \(S-parameters\), gain, radiation pattern, and bandwidth are analyzed.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
150 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 110 0 R
/T (The simulated results demonstrate that the proposed antenna achieves good impedance matching at both frequency bands, stable radiation characteristics, and effective isolation between ports. These features make it suitable for applications in radar imaging, remote sensing, and satellite communication systems.)
/E (The simulated results demonstrate that the proposed antenna achieves good impedance matching at both frequency bands, stable radiation characteristics, and effective isolation between ports. These features make it suitable for applications in radar imaging, remote sensing, and satellite communication systems.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [6]
>>
