/Title (The primary objective of this work is to develop an antenna system capable of operating at two distinct frequency bands while maintaining high performance in terms of gain, bandwidth, and isolation. Dual-band functionality allows the antenna to support multiple radar frequencies, thereby improving imaging capabilities and system flexibility.)
/Dest [12 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1243 0 R
/Prev 1345 0 R
/Next 1502 0 R
>>
endobj
1448 0 obj
