/Title (The antenna structure is implemented using microstrip technology, which provides advantages such as compact size, low cost, ease of fabrication, and compatibility with printed circuit boards. The design and simulation are carried out using CST Microwave Studio, where key parameters such as return loss \(S-parameters\), gain, radiation pattern, and bandwidth are analyzed.)
/Dest [12 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1243 0 R
/Prev 1502 0 R
/Next 1346 0 R
>>
